'''Fuling shamans''' are aggressive [[creatures]] found in [[Plains]] occupying [[Fuling Village]]s. They are ritualistic, goblin-like beings that appear to possess their own tribalistic culture. It is implied through [[Runestone|runestones]] and [[Fuling Totem|totems]] that they worship [[Yagluth]], a long dead king.

