== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Fuling shamans|Aggressive creature strategies#Fuling shaman}}

=== Protect ===
Casts a protective barrier over all allies within a 6-meter radius, negating up to 100 damage before breaking or lasting for up to 40 seconds. This ability has a 40-second cooldown and can be used within 60 meters of a player.

=== Poke ===
Jabs the player with their feather staff, reaching out 2 meters and creating a 40-degree horizontal arc (100 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]] damage). This ability has a 2-second cooldown and can be used within 1.5 meters of a player.

=== Fireball ===
Shoots a fireball at the player, which applies the [[Burning]] status (20 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]] and 100 [[Damage types#Fire|Fire]] damage). The projectile travels at 15 meters per second for up to 4 seconds before despawning and has a spread of 4–20 degrees. This attack has a 3-second cooldown and can be used when within 0–20 meters of a player.

